OL,3,AAt least 15 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia's latest attack on Kyiv marks
OL,7,Fthe first time in several months
OL,8,Fcritical infrastructure "was
OL,9,Fpurposefully attacked" in the Ukrainian
OL,10,Fcapital, the city's mayor said.
OL,12,FAt least 15 people have been killed as
OL,13,Fblocks of flats and warehouses were
OL,14,Fstruck across the city overnight, the
OL,15,FState Emergency Service of Ukraine
OL,16,Fsaid. A children's hospital and school
OL,17,Fwere also damaged, and more than 40
OL,18,Fpeople have been injured, it added.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
