OL,3,AAt least 15 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, Kyiv's mayor Vitali
OL,7,FKlitschko warned residents of
OL,8,FDesnyansky and part of the Dnipro
OL,9,Fdistricts may experience a disrupted
OL,10,Fsupply of hot water, following the
OL,11,Fovernight attacks.
OL,13,F"Specialists are working to restore the
OL,14,Fdamaged infrastructure," he said on
OL,15,FTelegram, external.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
